# Optional Siteverify test mode, not needed for the default offline local mock.
# Copy to ignored .dev.vars, restart pnpm dev. Never use real customer data.
# APP_ENV must remain local, and the Worker also requires a loopback hostname.
# TURNSTILE_MODE=siteverify-test
# TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
# These are Cloudflare's PUBLIC TEST keys, not production credentials.
# siteverify-test accepts synthetic metadata only with this public test secret
# and local+loopback checks. Real siteverify mode always checks hostname/action.
